+- **Statistics → Volumes:** scenes, words, goal, progress, deadline, words per day, and **open setups at the end of each volume**. (1.11.8-km.5, km.6)
+- **Export:** "Volume" choice for Manuscript and Outline. (1.11.8-km.5)
